  Id: note_ledger
  DisplayName: Ledger Page 12
  Kind: 1
  Body: 'Entry struck through twice. Someone has written the date again underneath, smaller, as if to hide it.


    The day the ledger was sealed is written on the spine of the open ledger here.


    Stamp returned to the end shelf, far side.'
